From a9668f2e4b8bf82c67728291165c8c35ffea5bf6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:34:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libvpl: Restore Android build glue excluded from v2.16.0
 overlay

The v2.16.0 release tag doesn't carry Android.bp files (api/, examples/,
libvpl/) -- those are a fork-local addition for the Android build,
deliberately excluded when overlaying the real upstream tag. Restores
them verbatim from the prior Android-tracking state.

This commit exists so the manifest can pin this project directly to
the real v2.16.0 tag (778a66d6c6537f08eabb91955dbbf1bce3812894) instead
of carrying the whole tag's tree as a single large patch -- only this
Android-glue delta and the 3 follow-on fixes layered on top of it need
to live in utils_vertical now.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 api/Android.bp      | 31 +++++++++++++++
 examples/Android.bp | 92 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libvpl/Android.bp   | 78 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 201 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 api/Android.bp
 create mode 100644 examples/Android.bp
 create mode 100644 libvpl/Android.bp

diff --git a/api/Android.bp b/api/Android.bp
new file mode 100644
